♪ Matinee in the day,
check my pocket watch ♪

18:04.417 --> 18:06.486
♪ There's no lies
and I can't front ♪

18:06.519 --> 18:08.755
Seen it in a movie once ♪

18:08.821 --> 18:11.824
♪ Robocop in the street
with an Uzi once. ♪

19:01.374 --> 19:03.443
Oh.

19:03.476 --> 19:05.478
Can I help you?

19:05.478 --> 19:07.947
Hey, uh...

19:07.980 --> 19:09.949
Yeah, I was, um...

19:09.982 --> 19:11.451
Are you here for Blueblood?

19:11.484 --> 19:14.120
- Yeah, yeah.

19:14.153 --> 19:16.122
Is he performing?

19:16.155 --> 19:17.957
Uh, no.

19:17.990 --> 19:20.493
He's dead.

19:20.493 --> 19:22.562
Is that news to you?

19:24.664 --> 19:26.833
I'm Keisha.

19:26.899 --> 19:28.801
Gary's wife.

19:28.835 --> 19:31.738
- I'm Al.

19:31.771 --> 19:33.340
Blueblood's name was Gary?

19:35.174 --> 19:37.143
Yeah.

19:37.176 --> 19:39.679
So what's all this?

19:39.746 --> 19:42.682
Well, this is Gary's funeral.

19:43.683 --> 19:45.752
The way he wanted it.

19:45.785 --> 19:47.854
Hmm.

19:51.591 --> 19:54.594
Gary was always trying
to outdo himself.

19:54.627 --> 19:56.696
You know.

19:56.696 --> 19:58.865
I remember he used to talk
about the culture.

19:58.931 --> 20:01.100
And how he was doing it
for the culture.

20:01.133 --> 20:03.270
So...

20:03.303 --> 20:05.372
when he found out
he was gonna die,

20:05.438 --> 20:07.106
he decided to do this.

20:09.976 --> 20:12.211
He was pretty sick
towards the end, but...

20:12.279 --> 20:15.382
he still managed to record an
album and plan a scavenger hunt.

20:17.116 --> 20:20.620
T-shirts, comic books...

20:20.653 --> 20:22.989
barbecue sponsorships.

20:23.956 --> 20:25.958
Oh, are you hungry?

20:25.992 --> 20:28.027
Uh, no, no, I, um...

20:28.060 --> 20:29.729
I had something to eat
on the way over here.

20:29.796 --> 20:31.698
Oh, right.

20:31.731 --> 20:33.733
The zoo pie.

20:35.067 --> 20:37.069
I promised him
I'd run the funeral.

20:38.305 --> 20:41.408
You're the fifth person
to show up.

20:41.474 --> 20:43.576
Damn.

20:43.576 --> 20:46.078
- Really?
- Yeah.

20:46.145 --> 20:48.147
I think he expected more people.

20:49.582 --> 20:51.584
I'm actually surprised, too.

20:51.651 --> 20:54.587
I mean, all you had to do
was listen to the album.

20:54.654 --> 20:57.089
Yeah.

20:57.156 --> 20:59.392
He put so much effort into it,

20:59.426 --> 21:03.195
but I guess you don't always get
back what you give.

21:04.931 --> 21:07.400
He just worked so hard.

21:07.434 --> 21:09.702
And I just wish
he had had more fun.

21:12.104 --> 21:14.273
'Cause that's all it is
in the end.

21:16.042 --> 21:17.944
Oh!

21:18.010 --> 21:20.347
You get one of those, too.

21:21.948 --> 21:24.951
Track 11 is how to care for it.

21:26.953 --> 21:28.921
That's dope.

21:28.955 --> 21:30.957
Mm-hmm.

21:34.627 --> 21:37.464
He really had an impact on me.

21:41.968 --> 21:43.803
May I?

21:43.870 --> 21:45.905
Sure.

22:01.488 --> 22:03.656
That's...

22:03.723 --> 22:05.658
that's not his skeleton.

22:05.725 --> 22:08.661
I had to have him cremated
about a month ago.

22:22.274 --> 22:24.343
Earn?

22:25.344 --> 22:26.746
Vanessa, long time no see--

22:26.779 --> 22:28.314
No, no, no, no, no, stay back!

22:28.347 --> 22:30.316
S-Stay back.

22:30.349 --> 22:32.151
Earn!

22:32.184 --> 22:34.186
- Van!
- Oh, my God.

22:36.188 --> 22:37.824
Did you find something?

22:37.857 --> 22:39.859
Is that a way out?

22:44.631 --> 22:46.533
I'm not going in there.

22:48.367 --> 22:50.703
Well, I'll check it out,
and then I'll come back

22:50.770 --> 22:52.338
if it ends up being legit.

22:52.371 --> 22:53.840
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.

22:53.873 --> 22:55.542
You're just gonna leave me,
and then I'm stuck here

22:55.542 --> 22:57.610
like the rest of your exes?

22:59.546 --> 23:02.449
I would never let you
become one of them.

23:02.482 --> 23:05.117
You know that, right?

23:09.556 --> 23:11.624
All right.

23:28.475 --> 23:31.210
- (gasps) What was that?

23:31.243 --> 23:32.912
Are the walls carpeted?

23:32.979 --> 23:35.381
Yeah, they are,
but why are they sopping wet?

23:35.414 --> 23:37.416
We're gonna have
to sl-slide through this

23:37.484 --> 23:39.652
Ooh, ow! Ow!
Earn, there's no room.

23:39.686 --> 23:41.754
I see, I see there,
I see a light in the corner.

23:41.821 --> 23:43.590
Ow! Ow! Wait, wait, wait!

23:43.656 --> 23:45.592
Okay, just keep moving.
I see a light, I see a light.

23:45.592 --> 23:47.760
- Just follow that.
- Okay. You do?
Okay, I'm kind of scared.

23:47.760 --> 23:50.429
- Calm down. I got, I know,
it's okay, it's okay.
- Okay.

23:50.497 --> 23:52.599
- All right, I'm stuck.
Okay, you're gonna have to...
- Oh! Oh, okay.

23:52.665 --> 23:54.601
- You're gonna have to kick me.
You're gonna...
- Okay.

23:56.002 --> 23:57.269
- I'm sorry! Okay.
- Not there!

23:57.336 --> 23:58.938
- On the, the head!
- I'm sorry!

23:58.938 --> 24:00.607
- On the head!
- I didn't mean it. I'm sorry!

24:00.607 --> 24:02.441
He was kind of like
a revolutionary. I mean, who...

24:02.441 --> 24:04.243
Nobody think about putting
stuff on tracks like that.

24:04.276 --> 24:06.278
- And making a scavenger hunt...
- I know, right? Yeah.

24:14.687 --> 24:16.422
Y'all fuck with Blueblood?

24:20.359 --> 24:22.862
I was following y'all.

24:22.895 --> 24:25.064
Kenya?

24:34.073 --> 24:36.809
Hey, you want me to, uh, give
you a ride to your car, man?

24:38.811 --> 24:40.947
Nah, they can keep it.

24:44.884 --> 24:46.553
Is that Darius?

24:46.586 --> 24:48.821
Where? Hell yeah.

24:48.821 --> 24:50.957
Hey, yo, Darius!

24:50.990 --> 24:52.959
Oh.

24:52.992 --> 24:54.627
Yo.

24:59.431 --> 25:01.233
You okay?

25:01.267 --> 25:02.669
You look kind of rough.

25:02.735 --> 25:04.637
Yeah, it's been a...

25:04.671 --> 25:06.172
weird day.

25:07.840 --> 25:09.842
Hey, Al, can you get me
up out of here, man?

25:09.842 --> 25:12.645
- Like, quickly, please?
- All right.
Come on, man, let's go.

25:12.679 --> 25:15.347
- You gonna be all right?
- Yeah, I'll be all right.

25:16.683 --> 25:18.651
Hey, I'm Kenya.

25:18.685 --> 25:20.152
Hi.

25:20.186 --> 25:21.854
What's with the air fryer?

25:21.921 --> 25:24.023
- Ah, it was just a gift.

25:24.090 --> 25:26.959
I forgot to get
a gift for my dad.

25:27.960 --> 25:30.597
Uh, here.

25:30.630 --> 25:32.699
Wow, thank you.

25:32.765 --> 25:35.602
No, thank you.
My arms are getting tired.

25:37.637 --> 25:40.172
-* I was afraid,
never fuck with... *

25:40.206 --> 25:41.608
Kenya, you need a ride?

25:41.641 --> 25:43.442
My Uber's, like,
two minutes away.

25:43.475 --> 25:44.777
I'll be fine.

25:44.811 --> 25:46.779
- Thanks.
- Okay.

25:46.813 --> 25:48.615
Bye.

26:26.753 --> 26:28.921
-* Running away ♪

26:28.921 --> 26:31.090
To get away ♪

26:31.090 --> 26:33.425
Ha ha, ha ha ♪

26:33.425 --> 26:35.561
You're wearing out ♪

26:35.594 --> 26:39.165
Your shoes ♪

26:42.168 --> 26:45.171
Look at you fooling you ♪

26:45.204 --> 26:49.441
♪ Making blues
of night and day ♪

26:49.441 --> 26:51.944
Hee-hee, hee-hee ♪

26:52.011 --> 26:54.113
You're stretching out ♪

26:54.180 --> 26:57.116
Your dues ♪

27:00.452 --> 27:03.622
Look at you fooling you. ♪

27:03.690 --> 27:07.459
Captioned by
Media Access Group at WGBH
